<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="vp-lang" content="{{ lang }}">
<title>公共数据检索 - 植物病毒分析平台</title>
<script>try{if(localStorage.getItem("vp_theme")==="dark")document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme","dark")}catch(e){}</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/app.css?v={{ asset_v }}">
<style>
  .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; }
  .tbl-scroll { overflow: auto; max-height: 520px; border: 1px solid var(--line-100); border-radius: 8px; }
  .meta-tbl { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11.5px; }
  .meta-tbl th { position: sticky; top: 0; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 5px 7px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
                 white-space: nowrap; font-size: 10.5px; color: #555; z-index: 2; text-align: left; }
  .meta-tbl th.sortable { cursor: pointer; user-select: none; }
  .meta-tbl th.sortable:hover { background: #eaf2fb; }
  .meta-tbl td { padding: 4px 7px; border: 1px solid #ececec; white-space: nowrap; max-width: 280px;
                 overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .meta-tbl tbody tr:hover { background: #fafafa; }
  .meta-tbl td a { color: #0064c8; text-decoration: underline; }
  .meta-tbl td.editable { cursor: cell; }
  .meta-tbl td.miss { background: #ffffc8; color: #b43232; }
  .meta-tbl td.aimark { background: #dcffdc; }
  .meta-tbl td.sus { background: #fff3e0; color: #e65100; }
  .meta-tbl td .cell-input { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font: inherit; border: 1.5px solid #4a90d9;
                 padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px; }
  .badge2 { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px;
            background: #eef3f8; color: #456; border: 1px solid #dbe4ee; }
  .badge2.ok { background: #e9f7ef; color: #217346; border-color: #cdebd8; }
  .badge2.warn { background: #fff3e0; color: #b35c00; border-color: #f0d0a0; }
  .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 8px 0; }
  .toolbar select { width: auto; max-width: 200px; }
  .toolbar .sep { width: 1px; height: 22px; background: var(--line-100); margin: 0 2px; }
  .search-log { font-family: Consolas, var(--mono); font-size: 11px; background: #f8f8f8;
                border: 1px solid var(--line-100); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px;
                max-height: 130px; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 8px; }
  .stat-line { font-size: 11.5px; color: #567; margin: 4px 0; }
  .edit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .edit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .rec-form { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 6px 14px; }
  .rec-form label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-size: 11px; color: #567; }
  .rec-form input { font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 6px; }
  .rec-form input.miss { background: #ffffc8; }
  .rec-form input.aimark { background: #dcffdc; }
  .rec-nav { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .fig-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .fig-item { border: 1px solid var(--line-100); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px; background: #fff; }
  .fig-item img { width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .chart-box { border: 1px solid var(--line-100); border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px; margin-top: 10px; background: #fff; }
  .chart-head { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .mt-status { position: sticky; bottom: 0; background: var(--bg, #fff); border-top: 1px solid var(--line-100);
               padding: 6px 4px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #567; font-family: var(--mono); z-index: 5; }
  .mt-modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(20,30,50,.35); display: flex;
              align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 50; }
  .mt-modal .box { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; min-width: 420px; max-width: 640px;
                   max-height: 82vh; overflow: auto; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); }
  .combo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 6px 12px; }
  .combo-grid label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #456; }
  .combo-grid label span { min-width: 108px; text-align: right; }
  .proj-bar { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
{% include "_nav.html" %}

<div class="page">
  <div class="tools-layout group-layout">
    {% include "_group_nav.html" %}
    <main class="group-main">
  <div class="pipe-head">
    <div>
      <h1 data-i18n="mt.title">🔎 公共数据检索（SRA + GSA）</h1>
      <p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.hint2">双存储工作台（Search / Info）：检索 SRA + GSA → 表格直接编辑（双击单元格）→ AI 清洗补全 → 图表全景。
         每次检索自动新建项目并归档到「结果中心」，本页只操作当前项目。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 项目条：当前项目 + 切换 + 结果中心入口 -->
  <div class="card">
    <div class="proj-bar">
      <b data-i18n="mt.curColl">当前项目</b>:
      <select id="mtProjectSel" onchange="switchProject(this.value)" style="max-width:340px"></select>
      <span id="mtProjBadges" style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap"></span>
      <span style="flex:1"></span>
      <a class="btn small" href="/results#meta">🗂 <span data-i18n="mt.toResults">结果中心查看全部项目</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 8 标签（复刻 metadata_gui：Search / S-Browse / S-Edit / S-Viz / Info / I-*） -->
  <nav class="group-topbar" style="margin-top:12px">
    <div class="gt-items" id="mtPills">
      <a class="gt-item on" data-sec="search" href="#search">① <span data-i18n="mt.tabSearch">检索</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="sb" href="#sb">S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabBrowse">浏览</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="se" href="#se">S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabEdit">编辑</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="sv" href="#sv">S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabViz">图表</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="info" href="#info">Info <span data-i18n="mt.tabInfo">提取</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="ib" href="#ib">I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabBrowse">浏览</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="ie" href="#ie">I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabEdit">编辑</span></a>
      <a class="gt-item" data-sec="iv" href="#iv">I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabViz">图表</span></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- ═══ ① 检索 Search ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-search">
    <div class="card">
      <h2 data-i18n="mt.online">在线数据库检索（SRA / GSA）</h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <span data-i18n="mt.species">物种拉丁名</span>
        <input id="mtSpecies" type="text" placeholder="如 Lycium barbarum" style="flex:1;min-width:220px"
               onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')doSearch(this)">
        <span data-i18n="mt.source">测序类型</span>
        <select id="mtSource">
          <option value="TRANSCRIPTOMIC">TRANSCRIPTOMIC</option>
          <option value="GENOMIC">GENOMIC</option>
          <option value="METAGENOMIC">METAGENOMIC</option>
          <option value="OTHER">OTHER</option>
          <option value="All">All</option>
        </select>
        <span data-i18n="mt.workers">GSA 并发</span>
        <input id="mtWorkers" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="5" style="width:64px"
               title="GSA 并发爬取线程数（越高越快，但易触发限流）">
        <span data-i18n="mt.db">数据库</span>
        <select id="mtDb">
          <option value="both">SRA + GSA</option>
          <option value="sra">仅 SRA</option>
          <option value="gsa">仅 GSA</option>
        </select>
        <button class="btn primary" id="btnSearch" onclick="doSearch(this)" data-i18n="mt.go">🔍 开始检索</button>
      </div>
      <label class="chk" style="margin:0"><input type="checkbox" id="mtDetailed" checked>
        <span data-i18n="mt.detailed">详细模式（解析 Tissue / Location / 发育阶段）</span></label>
      <div class="search-log" id="searchLog">检索进度将显示在这里…</div>
      <div class="toolbar" id="searchActions" style="display:none">
        <b id="searchCount" class="stat-line"></b>
        <button class="btn small primary" onclick="mtShow('sb')" data-i18n="mt.toBrowse">📄 打开 S-浏览（表格可编辑）</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="searchToInfo()" data-i18n="mt.sendInfo">📤 发送到 Info 提取</button>
        <span style="flex:1"></span>
        <span class="hint" data-i18n="mt.autoArchive">ⓘ 每次检索自动新建项目并归档到结果中心</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2 data-i18n="mt.localFilter">本地元数据筛选（当前 S 存储）</h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <input id="mtQuick" type="text" style="flex:1;min-width:200px"
               placeholder="检索已载入记录…（如 'leaf'、'Lycium'，回车筛选）"
               onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')localFilter()">
        <button class="btn small" onclick="localFilter()" data-i18n="mt.filter">筛选</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="localClear()" data-i18n="mt.clear">清除</button>
      </div>
      <div class="combo-grid" id="mtLocalFilters"></div>
      <p class="stat-line" id="mtLocalCount"></p>
      <div id="mtLocalTbl"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.none2">尚无数据——先在上方检索，或切换项目</p></div>
      <div id="mtLocalPager"></div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sec" data-i18n="mt.tasks">运行任务</h2>
    <div id="taskBox"><p class="hint" data-i18n="c.noTasks">暂无任务</p></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ S-浏览 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-sb" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabBrowse">浏览</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.searchStore">检索结果</span>（<span data-i18n="mt.editableTip">双击单元格可直接编辑</span>）</h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <input id="sbQ" type="text" style="flex:1;min-width:160px" placeholder="全字段检索…（回车筛选，Esc 清除）"
               onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')browseFilter('sb');if(event.key==='Escape'){this.value='';browseFilter('sb')}">
        <select id="sbQCol" style="max-width:170px"><option value="">全部列</option></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="browseFilter('sb')" data-i18n="mt.filter">筛选</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="browseClear('sb')" data-i18n="mt.clear">清除</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="fillCache('search',this)" title="从本地网页缓存 JSON 回填缺失字段"
                data-i18n="mt.fillCache">🧩 缓存填充</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="aiFillOpen('search')" title="DeepSeek 清洗/补全缺失元数据"
                style="color:#0072B2;font-weight:bold" data-i18n="mt.aiFill">✨ AI 补全缺失</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="importClick('search')" data-i18n="mt.import">📥 导入文件</button>
        <select id="sbExportFmt"><option value="csv">CSV</option><option value="tsv">TSV</option><option value="xlsx">Excel</option></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="doExport('search','sbExportFmt')" data-i18n="mt.export">⬇ 导出</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="aiSummary('search',this)" style="color:#0072B2;font-weight:bold"
                data-i18n="mt.aiSummary">📝 AI 总结</button>
        <button class="btn small danger" onclick="delRows('search')" data-i18n="mt.delRows">🗑 删除选中行</button>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbar" id="sbSelBar" style="display:none">
        <button class="btn small primary" onclick="intoDownload(this)" data-i18n="mt.intoDl">⬇ 勾选 Run 转入数据下载</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="selToInfo()" data-i18n="mt.selInfo">📋 勾选 Run 提取元数据</button>
        <span class="hint" id="sbSelCount"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="stat-line" id="sbStats"></p>
      <div class="tbl-scroll"><div id="sbTbl"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needSearch">尚无检索结果——先在「① 检索」检索</p></div></div>
      <div id="sbPager"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ S-编辑 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-se" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabEdit">编辑</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.recordDetail">记录详情（行级查看与编辑）</span></h2>
      <div id="seBox"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needSearch">尚无检索结果——先在「① 检索」检索</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ S-图表 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-sv" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>S-<span data-i18n="mt.tabViz">图表</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.vizTitle">元数据可视化</span></h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <span data-i18n="mt.mainField">主字段</span>
        <select id="svField" onchange="loadViz('search')"></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="loadViz('search', true)" data-i18n="mt.refreshCharts">🔄 刷新图表</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small primary" onclick="metaPlot(this)" data-i18n="mt.plot">📊 生成 SCI 全景图</button>
      </div>
      <div id="svSummary"></div>
      <div id="svSci"></div>
      <div id="svCharts"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needSearch">尚无检索结果——先在「① 检索」检索</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ Info 提取 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-info" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Info · <span data-i18n="mt.info">元数据深度提取（Run → Core14/Full）</span></h2>
      <p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.infoHint">粘贴 Run 编号（逗号 / 空格 / 换行分隔）；留空 = 使用当前项目检索到的全部 Run。</p>
      <textarea id="infoRuns" rows="5" style="width:100%;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px"
                placeholder="SRR31651831&#10;CRR1126132&#10;ERR13512478&#10;..."></textarea>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <button class="btn small" onclick="infoPullSearch()" data-i18n="mt.pullSearch">📥 从 S-检索拉取</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="$('infoFile').click()" data-i18n="mt.loadFile">📂 载入文件</button>
        <input type="file" id="infoFile" style="display:none" onchange="infoLoadFile(this)">
        <button class="btn small" onclick="$('infoRuns').value=''" data-i18n="mt.clear">清除</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <label class="chk" style="margin:0"><input type="checkbox" id="mtFillDate" checked>
          <span data-i18n="mt.fillDate">采集日期缺失时用发布日期兜底</span></label>
        <input id="infoKey" type="password" placeholder="DeepSeek Key（可选，留空用环境变量/本地规则）"
               style="width:260px">
        <span style="flex:1"></span>
        <button class="btn primary" id="btnInfoRun" onclick="doInfo(this)" data-i18n="mt.infoGo">📋 深度提取元数据</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.aiHint2">可选：设置环境变量 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 后自动启用 AI 清洗；未设置时用纯本地规则解析。</p>
      <div class="search-log" id="infoLog" style="display:none"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ I-浏览 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-ib" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabBrowse">浏览</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.infoStore">Core14 统一元数据</span>（<span data-i18n="mt.editableTip">双击单元格可直接编辑</span>）</h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <input id="ibQ" type="text" style="flex:1;min-width:160px" placeholder="全字段检索…（回车筛选，Esc 清除）"
               onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')browseFilter('ib');if(event.key==='Escape'){this.value='';browseFilter('ib')}">
        <select id="ibQCol" style="max-width:170px"><option value="">全部列</option></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="browseFilter('ib')" data-i18n="mt.filter">筛选</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="browseClear('ib')" data-i18n="mt.clear">清除</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="fillCache('core14',this)" title="从本地网页缓存 JSON 回填缺失字段"
                data-i18n="mt.fillCache">🧩 缓存填充</button>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="aiFillOpen('core14')" title="DeepSeek 清洗/补全缺失元数据"
                style="color:#0072B2;font-weight:bold" data-i18n="mt.aiFill">✨ AI 补全缺失</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="importClick('core14')" data-i18n="mt.import">📥 导入文件</button>
        <select id="ibExportFmt"><option value="csv">CSV</option><option value="tsv">TSV</option><option value="xlsx">Excel</option></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="doExport('core14','ibExportFmt')" data-i18n="mt.export">⬇ 导出</button>
        <a class="btn small" id="ibFullDl" href="#" download data-i18n="mt.fullDl">⬇ Full 明细</a>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="aiSummary('core14',this)" style="color:#0072B2;font-weight:bold"
                data-i18n="mt.aiSummary">📝 AI 总结</button>
        <button class="btn small danger" onclick="delRows('core14')" data-i18n="mt.delRows">🗑 删除选中行</button>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbar" id="ibSelBar" style="display:none">
        <button class="btn small primary" onclick="intoDownload(this,'core14')" data-i18n="mt.intoDl">⬇ 勾选 Run 转入数据下载</button>
        <span class="hint" id="ibSelCount"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="stat-line" id="ibStats"></p>
      <div class="tbl-scroll"><div id="ibTbl"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needInfo">尚无元数据——在「Info 提取」运行深度提取</p></div></div>
      <div id="ibPager"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ I-编辑 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-ie" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabEdit">编辑</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.recordDetail">记录详情（行级查看与编辑）</span></h2>
      <div id="ieBox"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needInfo">尚无元数据——在「Info 提取」运行深度提取</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ═══ I-图表 ═══ -->
  <div class="mt-sec" id="sec-iv" style="display:none">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>I-<span data-i18n="mt.tabViz">图表</span> · <span data-i18n="mt.vizTitle">元数据可视化</span></h2>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <span data-i18n="mt.mainField">主字段</span>
        <select id="ivField" onchange="loadViz('core14')"></select>
        <button class="btn small" onclick="loadViz('core14', true)" data-i18n="mt.refreshCharts">🔄 刷新图表</button>
        <span class="sep"></span>
        <button class="btn small primary" onclick="metaPlot(this)" data-i18n="mt.plot">📊 生成 SCI 全景图</button>
      </div>
      <div id="ivSummary"></div>
      <div id="ivSci"></div>
      <div id="ivCharts"><p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.needInfo">尚无元数据——在「Info 提取」运行深度提取</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-status" id="mtStatus">Search: 0 rows | Info: 0 rows</div>
  </main>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- AI 补全弹窗 -->
<div class="mt-modal" id="aiModal" style="display:none">
  <div class="box">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0" id="aiTitle">✨ AI 补全缺失（DeepSeek）</h2>
    <p class="hint" id="aiWhichLabel"></p>
    <p class="hint" data-i18n="mt.aiFillHint">AI 将对含部分信息的记录做去污染 / 归位 / 格式化（Location 按机构推断，标注 _AI 后缀）；绿色单元格 = AI 修改。需要环境变量 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY。</p>
    <div class="toolbar">
      <span>模型</span>
      <select id="aiModel">
        <option value="deepseek-v4-flash">deepseek-v4-flash（快速）</option>
        <option value="deepseek-v4-pro">deepseek-v4-pro（深度）</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-line" id="aiProg"></div>
    <div class="toolbar" style="justify-content:flex-end">
      <button class="btn small danger" id="aiStop" style="display:none;margin-right:auto" onclick="aiStopTask()">⏹ 停止</button>
      <button class="btn" onclick="aiModalClose()" data-i18n="c.close">关闭</button>
      <button class="btn primary" id="aiStart" onclick="aiFillStart()" data-i18n="mt.aiGo">▶ 开始 AI 补全</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- AI 总结弹窗 -->
<div class="mt-modal" id="sumModal" style="display:none">
  <div class="box" style="min-width:560px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">📝 AI <span data-i18n="mt.aiSummary">总结</span></h2>
    <textarea id="sumText" rows="12" style="width:100%;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6"></textarea>
    <div class="toolbar" style="justify-content:flex-end">
      <button class="btn" onclick="copySum()" data-i18n="c.copy">复制</button>
